第1句 引出谜题:One of the greatest mysteries is what …
第2句 同位语强调:The fact that … still puzzles us.
第3-4句 解释:Some believe that … , while others argue that …
第5句 已知:What we do know is that …
第6句 结论:Why … may never be answered, but the search goes on.', 2, 'elective4', 'U5', 'fltrp');

